Package: ckdata
Title: Query Amazon Athena
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Adam", "Blake", email = "adam@ablake.dev", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("CourseKata", role = "cph")
  )
Description: A read-only DBI and dbplyr interface to Amazon Athena.
    A shared Rust core executes Athena queries through Parquet and returns
    Arrow results, including schemas for empty results. Researchers can use
    lazy dplyr queries, SQL, temporary saved results and reproducible snapshots.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/coursekata/ckdata
BugReports: https://github.com/coursekata/ckdata/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.94.1, xz,
    AWS CLI v2 (optional, for interactive AWS SSO sign-in)
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
